    "text": "BY virtue of the Powers vested in me under the Section (I) of 66 (C) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and the provision of section 66 (G) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, I do hereby informed that the name mentioned below was elected and declared by me as new Chairman of Koralai Pattu West Pradeshiya Sabha in Batticaloa District with in the meeting held on the day of 2025.11.20 at 10.00 am at the Koralai Pattu West Pradeshiya Sabha Hall.",
